00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.235
- I think for the
people to realizing

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.636
that this is America's,

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:06.606
our moment of cultural
revolution is happening.

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:10.343
