00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:43.309
If I said yes, I could
not become American.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.778
And that's what Google does,

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:47.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's what Facebook
does, what Instagram does,

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.681 align:start size:81% position:19%
and that what used
to Twitter did.

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:51.418
