- Mostly peaceful.

00:06:49.675 --> 00:06:50.877
That's what they say.

00:06:50.877 --> 00:06:53.112 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Yes, and then we could
not go buy the milk

00:06:53.112 --> 00:06:56.649 align:start size:97% position:3%
