00:07:27.713 --> 00:07:31.250
I know that I'm risking my
own life taking the subway.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.952
And why is it so grimmer

00:07:32.952 --> 00:07:36.155
is that when I was escaping
from North Korea and China,

00:07:36.155 --> 00:07:38.825
I had at least a
place to escape to.

00:07:38.825 --> 00:07:40.059
That was America.

00:07:40.059 --> 00:07:41.928 align:start size:88% position:13%
There was a free country
there waiting for me.

00:07:41.928 --> 00:07:45.898
I am scared every day for my
