00:07:45.898 --> 00:07:48.100
I cannot imagine the
world without America.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.570 align:start size:84% position:16%
Where would my son
escape to for freedom?

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.238
There's no place left.

00:07:52.238 --> 00:07:55.641
