00:08:59.672 --> 00:09:01.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, you know,
obviously everyone knows,

00:09:01.974 --> 00:09:03.609
in Florida where you just were,

00:09:03.609 --> 00:09:05.044
and you're coming
back pretty soon.

00:09:05.044 --> 00:09:06.279
I mean, it's here.

00:09:06.279 --> 00:09:08.881 align:start size:84% position:16%
There is this sense
of let's fight for it.

00:09:08.881 --> 00:09:11.517
But we are losing a lot of
the states at the moment.

00:09:12.685 --> 00:09:14.620
- I think for the
people to realizing

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.055
that this is America's,

00:09:16.055 --> 00:09:18.991
our moment of cultural
revolution is happening.

00:09:18.991 --> 00:09:22.728
This is a silent revolution
in happening classrooms,

00:09:22.728 --> 00:09:25.531 align:start size:88% position:13%
in corporate businesses,
in the media.

00:09:25.531 --> 00:09:28.167
It's happening everywhere,
and we just don't see it,

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:29.835
and media is lying to us.

00:09:29.835 --> 00:09:32.972
They are changing entire
dynamic of this country

00:09:32.972 --> 00:09:35.241
where somehow hate
speech is a violence,

00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:37.476
therefore, you have no
