00:09:37.476 --> 00:09:39.579 align:start size:84% position:16%
And that's not the
definition of freedom.

00:09:39.579 --> 00:09:42.415
People don't even understand
what it means to be American,

00:09:42.415 --> 00:09:44.083
and they're Americans.

00:09:44.083 --> 00:09:46.319
Like, I became a
citizen last year,

00:09:46.319 --> 00:09:49.121
