00:09:52.959 --> 00:09:55.628
If I said yes, I could
not become American.

00:09:55.628 --> 00:09:57.096
And that's what Google does,

00:09:57.096 --> 00:09:57.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's what Facebook
does, what Instagram does,

00:09:59.465 --> 00:10:01.434 align:start size:81% position:19%
and that what used
to Twitter did.

00:10:01.434 --> 00:10:03.970
So these people have no idea
what it means to be American.

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:05.972 align:start size:84% position:16%
They are there running
these institutions

00:10:05.972 --> 00:10:08.574
and brainwashing all of
us to believe that some,

00:10:08.574 --> 00:10:11.077 align:start size:88% position:13%
this authoritarian
rule is somehow better.

00:10:11.077 --> 00:10:13.045 align:start size:88% position:13%
So I think that
revolution really starts

00:10:13.045 --> 00:10:15.848
