00:12:20.506 --> 00:12:23.509
the three to eight generations
of your family get executed.

00:12:23.509 --> 00:12:25.811
And they do, and they
get all get killed.

00:12:25.811 --> 00:12:28.380 align:start size:97% position:3%
In America, we are
currently don't get executed

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.715
for saying the wrong thing.

00:12:29.715 --> 00:12:30.883
Maybe we get censored,

00:12:30.883 --> 00:12:32.384
we called a racist and bigot,

00:12:32.384 --> 00:12:35.588
