And that really is the
reason that not enough people

00:18:51.697 --> 00:18:55.134 align:start size:84% position:16%
will ever step up
until it's too late.

00:18:55.134 --> 00:18:56.168
- Yeah, that's the thing.

00:18:56.168 --> 00:18:57.669
There's TikTok, right?

00:18:57.669 --> 00:19:01.974 align:start position:0%
There's a social media
platforms and all this Netflix,

00:19:01.974 --> 00:19:03.342
everything distracting us.

00:19:03.342 --> 00:19:07.246 align:start position:0%
We're so busy getting
entertained by this empty stuff.

00:19:07.246 --> 00:19:09.348 align:start size:84% position:16%
And that is very
toxic a lot of times,

00:19:09.348 --> 00:19:12.217 align:start size:84% position:16%
