I see currently.

00:19:23.362 --> 00:19:24.830
And raising a child,

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:28.333
like it's really scary thing
right now currently in America.

00:19:28.333 --> 00:19:32.171
And I think that's why I send
my child now Catholic school

00:19:32.171 --> 00:19:34.406
and sending him to church.

00:19:34.406 --> 00:19:37.042 align:start size:84% position:16%
I think at some
point it's beyond us.

00:19:37.042 --> 00:19:39.378
And one thing that I know,

00:19:39.378 --> 00:19:41.213
whenever there is a
communist revolution,

00:19:41.213 --> 00:19:43.615
the first thing they do
is going after religion.

00:19:44.483 --> 00:19:46.418
And that is very scary right now

00:19:46.418 --> 00:19:49.321 align:start size:97% position:3%
how much religion is
getting attacked in America

00:19:49.321 --> 00:19:50.556
and the people have no,

00:19:50.556 --> 00:19:51.957 align:start size:81% position:19%
