00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:56.995
And in North Korea, I know,

00:19:56.995 --> 00:20:00.933
they killed God, and
they became God, right?

00:20:00.933 --> 00:20:03.001 align:start size:81% position:19%
And they became
the most evil God.

00:20:03.001 --> 00:20:05.804
So, yeah, I mean
at the end of day,

00:20:05.804 --> 00:20:06.972
I just do everything
I can do in my power

00:20:06.972 --> 00:20:08.907
