City as an Asian woman.

00:20:14.479 --> 00:20:16.248
Obviously, I don't wanna
play identity politics,

00:20:16.248 --> 00:20:19.585
but there really is a rash of
violence against Asian people.

00:20:19.585 --> 00:20:21.086
Even when I was there last week,

00:20:21.086 --> 00:20:23.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
there was a story about
an Asian woman just being,

00:20:23.555 --> 00:20:25.757
