00:20:57.456 --> 00:20:59.057 align:start size:81% position:19%
Like, I used to
live in Manhattan,

00:20:59.057 --> 00:21:00.926
now, I just moved out to Queens.

00:21:00.926 --> 00:21:03.295
The K-Town is 32nd Broadway.

00:21:03.295 --> 00:21:04.997
It's the most like,
Asian community.

00:21:04.997 --> 00:21:06.632
We don't have drugs there.

00:21:06.632 --> 00:21:09.034
Now, there are the
drug lords sending,

00:21:09.034 --> 00:21:11.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
