drugs in the purple wrap.

00:21:11.069 --> 00:21:12.437
Looks like a lollipop.

00:21:12.437 --> 00:21:13.905
And my son thinks
it's a lollipop.

00:21:13.905 --> 00:21:15.674
He ask me to buy him that.

00:21:15.674 --> 00:21:17.109
And that's a drug.

00:21:17.109 --> 00:21:18.543
And there's a cop standing there

00:21:18.543 --> 00:21:19.811
doing nothing about it, right?

00:21:19.811 --> 00:21:22.514
They're just standing
there doing nothing.

00:21:22.514 --> 00:21:25.050
And I think this is why

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:27.519 align:start size:84% position:16%
