being ruined.

00:21:30.689 --> 00:21:33.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
And somehow, there's so
much resentment to America

00:21:33.625 --> 00:21:34.860
in their mind,

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:36.361 align:start size:81% position:19%
in their mind that
America deserve

00:21:36.361 --> 00:21:39.031
to get dismantled and destroyed.

00:21:39.031 --> 00:21:41.333 align:start size:97% position:3%
And maybe that's why
they're not doing anything.

00:21:41.333 --> 00:21:42.901
Because if you are,

00:21:42.901 --> 00:21:45.671
if you love your country,
in any little passive way,

00:21:45.671 --> 00:21:48.740
you cannot be sitting there
and your heart is not broke.

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:50.208
- Yeah, and then
at the same time,

00:21:50.208 --> 00:21:52.077
they'll gladly take
someone like you

00:21:52.077 --> 00:21:53.612
and throw you under the bus

00:21:53.612 --> 00:21:56.248 align:start size:84% position:16%
as you fight to give
them the freedoms

00:21:56.248 --> 00:21:58.717
that they're, you know,
in essence squandering.

00:22:00.185 --> 00:22:03.855
Do you find that some of
