00:22:03.855 --> 00:22:06.258 align:start size:88% position:13%
I mean, what else should
guys like me be doing

00:22:06.258 --> 00:22:08.093
and the people that you
are able to connect with

00:22:08.093 --> 00:22:09.261
and talk to,

00:22:09.261 --> 00:22:12.297 align:start size:88% position:13%
what should we be
doing to keep fighting?

00:22:12.297 --> 00:22:14.099
- No, I'm eternally grateful.

00:22:14.099 --> 00:22:17.202 align:start position:0%
When I was getting shadow
banned and censored everywhere,

00:22:17.202 --> 00:22:19.805
the locals gave me
community, right?

00:22:19.805 --> 00:22:22.007
I mean, now, Twitter got freed.

00:22:22.007 --> 00:22:24.609 align:start size:84% position:16%
But I mean, you
guys did that before

00:22:24.609 --> 00:22:27.913 align:start size:97% position:3%
where like, we had no place
to go speak our minds.

00:22:27.913 --> 00:22:29.614
And it was so,

00:22:29.614 --> 00:22:31.183
in a way, so oppressive,

00:22:31.183 --> 00:22:32.584 align:start size:84% position:16%
like, you know,
country you expected

00:22:32.584 --> 00:22:35.253
to have a freedom of
choice and voices,

00:22:35.253 --> 00:22:37.322
and we didn't have that.

00:22:37.322 --> 00:22:40.425
So I think people like
