00:22:40.425 --> 00:22:43.729
and finding opportunities
to give people freedom

00:22:43.729 --> 00:22:45.063
and make things better,

00:22:45.063 --> 00:22:46.565
I think that's very important.

00:22:46.565 --> 00:22:49.668 align:start size:84% position:16%
So thank you so much
