00:22:55.574 --> 00:22:59.611 align:start size:97% position:3%
What else is in the book that
people may not know about

00:22:59.611 --> 00:23:02.647 align:start size:97% position:3%
either your story or what
you're fighting for right now?

00:23:03.582 --> 00:23:05.150
- Yeah, I think that's where

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:06.651 align:start size:81% position:19%
people really need
to understand.

00:23:06.651 --> 00:23:10.489 align:start size:97% position:3%
You know, it's not like I
came to America with agenda.

00:23:10.489 --> 00:23:12.891
I didn't know what
left or right meant.

00:23:12.891 --> 00:23:14.126
That's like, you know,

00:23:14.126 --> 00:23:15.494 align:start size:88% position:13%
I did not even know what
Americas looked like.

00:23:15.494 --> 00:23:17.462
- [Dave] Yeah.
- So coming here,

00:23:17.462 --> 00:23:21.867 align:start size:97% position:3%
I was in the arms of the like,
really liberal left, right?

00:23:21.867 --> 00:23:23.869
Penguin giving me training say,

00:23:23.869 --> 00:23:25.303
"Don't ever talk

00:23:25.303 --> 00:23:26.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
about what you think
about Second Amendments."

00:23:26.805 --> 00:23:28.640
Because somebody was asking
me when I came to America,

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:30.709 align:start size:88% position:13%
"What do you think about
people owning guns?"

00:23:30.709 --> 00:23:33.278 align:start size:88% position:13%
And I was like, "That's
a fantastic thing."

00:23:33.278 --> 00:23:36.548 align:start size:88% position:13%
Because imagine if
North Koreans had guns,

00:23:36.548 --> 00:23:39.651
I was not going to let them
take my father like that.

00:23:39.651 --> 00:23:40.852
We are not gonna let them kill

00:23:40.852 --> 00:23:42.654
our eight generations of family.

00:23:42.654 --> 00:23:45.190
When you die anyway, you're
gonna fight to your death.

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:48.326
There's no country can
be ever be that enslaved

00:23:48.326 --> 00:23:51.029
when they have guns to
defend their rights.

00:23:51.029 --> 00:23:52.531
And even communism in Cambodia,

00:23:52.531 --> 00:23:53.799
that before the genocide,

00:23:53.799 --> 00:23:55.634
the first thing they did
was taking all the guns

00:23:55.634 --> 00:23:57.135
from the people.

00:23:57.135 --> 00:23:59.771
So my desire for owning that gun

00:23:59.771 --> 00:24:01.506
is a lot deeper than just like,

00:24:01.506 --> 00:24:02.974
some school shootings, right?

00:24:02.974 --> 00:24:04.476
It's not about that.

00:24:04.476 --> 00:24:05.844
And people were like,

00:24:05.844 --> 00:24:09.080
"Just don't ever, ever
say that in public."

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:10.048
And they were like,
"What do you like?"

00:24:10.048 --> 00:24:11.249
I said, "I like to read."

00:24:11.249 --> 00:24:12.717
And they go, "What
do you like to read?"

00:24:12.717 --> 00:24:14.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "I love to
read Bastiat's, 'The Law',

00:24:14.519 --> 00:24:16.655
John Stuart Mill, 'On Liberty'."

00:24:16.655 --> 00:24:17.923
And they were like--

00:24:17.923 --> 00:24:19.057
- I could see where
this is going, yeah.

00:24:19.057 --> 00:24:20.292
- Yeah, just don't say that.

00:24:20.292 --> 00:24:21.960 align:start size:84% position:16%
And back then, I did
not even know why

00:24:21.960 --> 00:24:23.428
was not allowed to say that.

00:24:23.428 --> 00:24:26.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
And because Penguin I
guess wanted to protect me

00:24:26.865 --> 00:24:29.100
before I get branded left.

00:24:29.100 --> 00:24:30.602
They just didn't
want me to do that.

00:24:30.602 --> 00:24:33.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they would keep
begging me to write about

00:24:33.438 --> 00:24:35.674
how hard it is to be a woman.

00:24:35.674 --> 00:24:38.210
You know, how oppressed
as a woman living life

00:24:38.210 --> 00:24:41.546 align:start size:97% position:3%
and how America is so
oppressed to the black men,

00:24:41.546 --> 00:24:43.215
putting them in the camps,

00:24:43.215 --> 00:24:45.283
which is like, same thing
we did to North Korean

00:24:45.283 --> 00:24:46.751
like political prison camp.

00:24:46.751 --> 00:24:49.221
I'm like, that's not even
the same thing, right?

00:24:49.221 --> 00:24:51.389 align:start size:97% position:3%
If you go to political
prison camp in North Korea,

00:24:51.389 --> 00:24:53.525 align:start size:84% position:16%
you don't make it even
until three months.

00:24:53.525 --> 00:24:55.427
These people keep going
and keep coming back out,

00:24:55.427 --> 00:24:56.495
and that's a problem.

00:24:57.662 --> 00:25:00.365 align:start size:88% position:13%
So I think that's the
people don't understand,

00:25:00.365 --> 00:25:03.134
like, I was not some
like, trained by CIA

00:25:03.134 --> 00:25:04.402
and giving these messages.

00:25:04.402 --> 00:25:06.705
I was a pure just
person coming here

00:25:06.705 --> 00:25:10.242 align:start size:97% position:3%
and seeing the tendencies that
I was seeing in North Korea

00:25:10.242 --> 00:25:11.776
happening in America.

00:25:11.776 --> 00:25:13.345
And it's coming from a,

00:25:13.345 --> 00:25:15.113
I don't know, it's a
really genuine place.

00:25:15.113 --> 00:25:16.848 align:start size:84% position:16%
Like, people don't
recognize this pattern

00:25:16.848 --> 00:25:19.985 align:start size:88% position:13%
because they never
seen a true oppression.

00:25:19.985 --> 00:25:22.387
And I see the same
pattern and tactics,

00:25:22.387 --> 00:25:23.855
and there is something called

00:25:23.855 --> 00:25:26.091
"The Dictator's
Handbook", right?

00:25:26.091 --> 00:25:28.260
And I feel like that's what
America's doing right now.

00:25:28.260 --> 00:25:30.228
They're going through
this manual handbook

00:25:30.228 --> 00:25:32.664 align:start size:84% position:16%
into how to control
full citizens.

00:25:32.664 --> 00:25:37.068 align:start position:0%
And they're playing all the
tactics coming from every angle.

00:25:37.068 --> 00:25:38.537
- Are you hopeful?

00:25:38.537 --> 00:25:40.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, despite everything
you're describing here

00:25:40.739 --> 00:25:43.875
and a sort of shock
to coming to America

00:25:43.875 --> 00:25:47.045
and seeing a, you know, you
came in a time when it was,

00:25:47.045 --> 00:25:48.980
we were in this
kind of upheaval,

00:25:48.980 --> 00:25:52.951
but are you hopeful that we
can do the right thing here?

00:25:52.951 --> 00:25:54.419
- Yeah, if we have,

00:25:54.419 --> 00:25:56.821
if we do fight for
our Second Amendment,

00:25:58.089 --> 00:26:00.525
I think we are never
gonna be the state

00:26:00.525 --> 00:26:02.794 align:start size:88% position:13%
of North Korea and
China, that's for sure.

00:26:02.794 --> 00:26:05.664
But I don't even know how
many generation can stand,

00:26:05.664 --> 00:26:09.167 align:start size:88% position:13%
understanding the
meaning of self-defense.

00:26:09.167 --> 00:26:10.368
You know, they think some,

00:26:10.368 --> 00:26:11.903
our government's keep
brainwashing them.

00:26:11.903 --> 00:26:14.072
The guns are bad, and there
are school shootings, right?

00:26:14.072 --> 00:26:16.474
That's the brainwashing
you keep going through.

00:26:16.474 --> 00:26:17.976 align:start size:84% position:16%
And eventually,
what's a narration,

00:26:17.976 --> 00:26:21.746 align:start position:0%
they're gonna stop understanding
the meaning of having a gun

00:26:21.746 --> 00:26:22.614
and give that up.

00:26:22.614 --> 00:26:24.049
And that, I don't know.

00:26:24.049 --> 00:26:25.483
So that's the thing.

00:26:25.483 --> 00:26:27.686
Like, other than being
pessimistic, optimistic,

00:26:27.686 --> 00:26:29.087
that's really irrelevant.

00:26:29.087 --> 00:26:30.655
I know what's the
right thing to do.

00:26:30.655 --> 00:26:33.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know it's my
responsibility as a mother

00:26:33.124 --> 00:26:36.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
to tell my son what I know
about the world, right?

00:26:36.294 --> 00:26:39.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's our responsibility
being adult,

00:26:39.030 --> 00:26:42.133
educating our children about
the things that we understand,

00:26:42.133 --> 00:26:45.036
so they can go further
understanding new things.

00:26:45.036 --> 00:26:46.838
But we have been
failing at that.

00:26:46.838 --> 00:26:48.807
We've been failing our children

00:26:48.807 --> 00:26:51.910
and not teaching them the
things that we understand.

00:26:51.910 --> 00:26:54.279 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I think that's why coming
from this new generation,

00:26:54.279 --> 00:26:56.915 align:start size:97% position:3%
believing that they're
oppressed living in America,

00:26:56.915 --> 00:26:59.117
and they wanna destroy
this country because,

00:26:59.117 --> 00:27:00.452 align:start size:81% position:19%
you know, this
country's bigoted,

00:27:00.452 --> 00:27:04.456 align:start size:88% position:13%
and they just heard that
from their teachers.

00:27:04.456 --> 00:27:07.926 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's nothing about
based in actual truth.

00:27:07.926 --> 00:27:10.829
- I was gonna ask you to
sum this all up nicely,

00:27:10.829 --> 00:27:13.298
but I don't know that you can
